   "stem_html": "Convert 693 to base 7.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Divide the number by 7.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"693 \\div 7 = 99\"></span> with no remainder.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"99{\\rm{R}}0\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step 2: Divide the quotient by 7.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"99 \\div 7 = 14\"></span> with a remainder. What is it?</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"7 \\times 14 = 98\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"99-98 = 1\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>The remainder is 1.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"14{\\rm{R}}1\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step 3: Divide the quotient by 7.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"14 \\div 7 = 2\"></span> with no remainder.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"2{\\rm{R}}0\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step 4: Divide the quotient by 7.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"2 \\div 7 = 0\"></span> with remainder 2.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"0{\\rm{R}}2\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The base 7 number has digits equal to the remainders in reverse order: <span data-math=\"{2010_7}\"></span>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "2010<sub>7</sub>"
    }
